      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `invoke_platform_model.py` that invokes a provider-managed model, I need to select a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in the code. I will use Amazon Bedrock as the provider, which is a concrete external service that offers managed machine learning models. The code will include the necessary imports and authentication to use the Amazon Bedrock service, and it will invoke a specific model provided by Amazon Bedrock. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
